     *   之前调 /Group/OperateChatRoomInfo — vendor swagger 236 paths 无此端点 (ghost) → 5 个群管理工具全挂
     *   vendor 实际有 3 个独立端点: SetChatRoomName / SetChatRoomAnnouncement / SetChatRoomRemarks
